  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b7b72a809a05de42b9e4e1a9fc3d116, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F436\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Dorothy's little black dog
  _description: A small black dog with long silky hair and merry little eyes. He
    keeps [[fcbf3650-903d-4ed3-a6f8-79e222116920|Dorothy Gale]] from being sad, and
    at the end it is Toto who knocks over the screen that hides [[65b6d1a1-296d-475f-baab-d3e054f15e99|Oz,
    the Great and Terrible]].
